        "en": "Pet owners consistently commend the boarding attendants, front desk staff, and grooming team for their warm, accommodating, and patient care. Reviewers note that employees welcome high-energy breeds and shy rescue dogs with genuine affection, ensuring each animal feels comfortable and secure during both short daycare sessions and extended boarding stays."
