      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight the facility's transparent and reassuring communication practices while their pets are boarded. Reviewers value the live suite webcams that allow owners to check in remotely at any hour, paired with frequent photo updates, text notifications, and phone calls regarding pet feeding habits, play milestones, and general wellbeing."
      }
    },
    {
