      "title": {
        "en": "Clean facility with 24-7 access"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents praise the secure, clean, and modern facility on Highland Avenue, highlighting private cat suites and dedicated playrooms for active dogs. Reviewers especially appreciate the twenty-four-seven pickup and drop-off flexibility, which easily accommodates nontraditional work schedules, late flights, and last-minute emergency boarding reservations."
      }
    }
